                <pb facs="0775" n="639" sameAs="frus:frus1929v01/pg639"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.796 Latin American Airways/11: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Geissler</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-05-14T17:00:00-04:00">May 14, 1929—5
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>24. Your 59, May 12, 4 p.m. Pending the receipt by it of fuller information as to
                    the status of both parties the Department desires you to adopt a non-committal
                    attitude and assumes that you can do so without jeopardizing the present rights
                    of either.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
